  (text "MeshGW Pi HAT - E22-900M30S carrier (rev A DRAFT, 2026-08-12)" (at 20.32 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dff45b35-f9d8-4fbd-9830-4dfcbd9d6557"))
  (text "DO NOT ORDER: E22 land pattern is datasheet-derived and has NOT been" (at 20.32 21.59 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1d0de778-0a66-4222-8139-56b3fa3a46f9"))
  (text "checked against a physical part. That is now the ONLY board blocker -" (at 20.32 26.67 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "260ae0b2-b26d-4da2-bd45-8793f7041c54"))
  (text "HAT mechanical geometry was verified vs the Pi 3B+ on 2026-08-12." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1f295f9e-eff3-4ef2-b64e-37b997850390"))
  (text "POWER: E22 VCC = +5V (Pi header pins 2/4), NOT 3V3." (at 20.32 203.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ed6b4a7a-ae03-45f1-a003-26153446a56b"))
  (text "  Datasheet: 2.5-5.5V range but '>=5.0V ensures output power'," (at 20.32 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "81f1dead-4678-4034-9f89-6ec7f3790b42"))
  (text "  650 mA instantaneous on a TX burst. The Pi 3V3 regulator must" (at 20.32 213.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9c5cc9a7-247e-42ce-ba87-9ec9288da3ab"))
  (text "  not carry that. Logic level is 3.3V so SPI wires straight to" (at 20.32 218.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "85acdff8-71fb-42b1-a734-bc0a2311e03f"))
  (text "  the Pi with no level shifting." (at 20.32 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "09d6a707-3a36-44f7-970d-a7231f23e59e"))
  (text "RF: pad 21 (ANT stamp hole) is NO-CONNECT by design. The antenna" (at 20.32 232.41 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "68383870-fc71-4947-8fed-eed7c5b99a46"))
  (text "  leaves through the module's own IPEX connector via an IPEX->SMA" (at 20.32 237.49 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a75d8cc3-c2cf-4444-aaab-fb258f622cbc"))
  (text "  bulkhead pigtail. Nothing on this 2-layer board is impedance-" (at 20.32 242.57 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "40824d2a-4b35-40a3-9e76-43d014e52308"))
  (text "  controlled, and a bad RF trace passes every automated check." (at 20.32 247.65 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d1335122-ff57-4143-9efa-e2f2eedcb03d"))
  (text "TXEN/RXEN are REQUIRED - the E22 has an RF switch. Leave them" (at 20.32 257.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "845590d9-1423-48d1-b32e-5682a6a4c6a6"))
  (text "  unconnected and the PA transmits into a closed switch." (at 20.32 262.89 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b14abef9-be55-45f8-9a45-f733c27898d9"))
  (text "NEVER power the module without an antenna: 1W into an open" (at 20.32 273.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d18326dd-d302-4bf3-acd3-10d565a85960"))
  (text "  circuit damages the PA." (at 20.32 278.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9068c10f-3d8d-4e04-98a6-55e3066547fb"))
  (text "PIN MAP (BCM) - generated from netlist.py, the ONE source:" (at 199.39 203.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f047330a-a3b2-4783-8a03-f6807a6a7dd1"))
  (text "  NSS  GPIO5  (hdr 29)   BUSY GPIO27 (hdr 13)" (at 199.39 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0de83b5f-217d-426d-9eed-ab60957d0f93"))
  (text "  SCK  GPIO11 (hdr 23)   DIO1 GPIO17 (hdr 11)" (at 199.39 213.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fdd15df6-dcca-4ea8-ba66-40c1e267324c"))
  (text "  MOSI GPIO10 (hdr 19)   NRST GPIO22 (hdr 15)" (at 199.39 218.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9adfcda1-8a4f-4a6b-aa34-108e43fe6ef3"))
  (text "  MISO GPIO9  (hdr 21)   TXEN GPIO13 (hdr 33)" (at 199.39 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ec08670d-9ebf-46b6-ac07-1a23df35cfb5"))
  (text "                         RXEN GPIO6  (hdr 31)" (at 199.39 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f34d8e3a-62f1-4878-abfe-09ff76fdb9c7"))
  (text "  This sheet and the PCB are both generated from it, so they" (at 199.39 232.41 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e370cf53-bcec-43eb-8cb3-b1041bd9182f"))
  (text "  cannot drift. config/meshtasticd/config.yaml is NOT generated -" (at 199.39 237.49 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "547432a8-06c4-4875-a4cd-b84cee9b1fc5"))
  (text "  re-pin here and you must hand-edit it or the radio won't start." (at 199.39 242.57 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ddc14a3e-3638-4687-9b24-5584b9d132d4"))
  (text "  Diverges from MeshAdv-Pi-Hat deliberately; netlist.py says why." (at 199.39 247.65 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5aa59a2c-af3b-489d-ada6-9fc05db6b3b8"))
  (text "GEOMETRY: 65 x 56.0 mm, R3 corners, notched for the Pi 3B+ PoE" (at 199.39 257.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2cc0fc09-1b6b-42bb-8557-c2ff67ef4916"))
  (text "  header J14 (those pins can carry ~48-57V on a PoE switch)." (at 199.39 262.89 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c53e67d5-5b1f-4e1f-93ab-377522540261"))
  (text "  Verified vs the official HAT spec 2026-08-12; check_geometry.py" (at 199.39 267.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "aea33572-b774-4d78-94bf-7d7baf05ffdc"))
